patrone-gnome-taskbar (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First package: Patrone's taskbar for the GNOME-based desktop, in place of
    GNOME's top bar. The Start menu (Super or the Patrone button) with
    type-to-search over GNOME's search providers and the web, pinned apps,
    recommended files and All apps; a search button; role slots for the
    default web browser, terminal, file manager and mail app; running apps;
    right-click jump lists; the top bar's tray, a two-line clock and Show
    desktop. On by default.

